2 CONC n, daughter of Emperor John IV Komnenos and Princess Georgina Bagrationi of Geogia. Their son was Maqsud Beg, who also was suspected of rebellion and arrested.
2 CONT
2 CONT Uzun Hassan’s uncle Kur Mohammad Bayondor was the father of Dana Khalil, who was thefather of Ebrahim Beg. This Ebrahim Beg, called Eybeh Soltan, was, in 1478, a powerfulwarlord and in fact is the first one associated with the Qaj
2 CONC ar tribe by name. He is mentioned ashead of a Qajar army (lashkar-e qajar ), which in 1492 defeated Yaqub’s son Baysonqor (r.1491-92) and put Maqsud’s son Rostam Mirza on the throne (r. 1493-1496)
2 CONT ==
