2 CONC ed to the latter, whereupon, they pro-  ceeded to Tabriz 11 . " ] ref: page 106 of https://archive.org/stream/HistoryOfShahIsmailSafawi-GhulamSarwar/119900259-History-of-Shah-Isma-il-Safawi-Ghulam-Sarwar_djvu.txt
