2 CONT Malipiero , Giovanni Antonio , son-in-law
2 CONT Loredan , Giovanni Francesco qu Marco Antonio , son-in-law
2 CONT Soranzo , Pietro , grandson
2 CONT Dandolo , Marco doctor cavalier , was his brother-in-law
