2 CONT
2 CONT - http://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marcantonio_Giustinian
2 CONT
2 CONT Marcantonio Giustinian (March 2, 1619 – March 23, 1688) was the 107th Doge of Venice, reigning from his election on January 26, 1684 until his death. Giustiniani was the quintessential Doge of the Republic of Venice, taking little
2 CONC  interest in affairs of state. He had little role in the conduct of the Morean War (1684-1699), which was raging during his time as Doge, though a number of military victories were secured by provveditore Francesco Morosini, who w
2 CONC ould later be Giustinian's successor as Doge.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://www.giustiniani.info/giustinian.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT  K5. N.H. Marcantonio (* Venezia 2-3-1619 + ivi 23-3-1688), 
2 CONT Patrizio Veneto, Prefetto dell’Annona, ambasciatore in Francia nel 1667 e creato Cavaliere dal Re di Francia, dei X Savi, Provveditore della zecca nel 1671, Inquisistore di terraferma 1672/1676, 
2 CONT eletto Doge della Repubblica di Venezia il 23-1-1684. 
